@best-practices

Purpose:
  Default engineering heuristics.

Use this index as a quick checklist before implementation.

Practices:
  @best-practices.solid
      Object oriented design principles.

  @best-practices.kiss
      Prefer simpler solution.

  @best-practices.dry
      Avoid accidental duplication.

  @best-practices.yagni
      Avoid speculative features.

  @best-practices.clean-code
      Readable and maintainable code.

  @best-practices.fail-fast
      Detect errors as early as possible.

  @best-practices.least-knowledge
      Minimize coupling between modules.

  @best-practices.composition-over-inheritance
      Prefer composition for flexibility.

DecisionGuide:
  Need design guidance?
    → @best-practices.solid

  Need simplicity?
    → @best-practices.kiss

  Need to avoid duplication?
    → @best-practices.dry

  Need to avoid over-engineering?
    → @best-practices.yagni

  Need code quality?
    → @best-practices.clean-code

  Need early error detection?
    → @best-practices.fail-fast

  Need loose coupling?
    → @best-practices.least-knowledge

  Need flexible extension?
    → @best-practices.composition-over-inheritance

RelatedReferences:
  @engineering

State: +
